	<!-- EN: disposable rocket launcher -->
	<CE_DisposableRocketLauncher.label>一次性火箭发射器</CE_DisposableRocketLauncher.label>
	<!-- EN: A lightweight single-use anti-tank launcher. Designed to provide soldiers in the field with a compact anti-armor weapon. -->
	<CE_DisposableRocketLauncher.description>一种轻型的一次性反坦克发射器。旨在为战场上的士兵提供紧凑型反装甲武器。</CE_DisposableRocketLauncher.description>
	<!-- EN: Body -->
	<CE_DisposableRocketLauncher.tools.Body.label>主体</CE_DisposableRocketLauncher.tools.Body.label>
	<!-- EN: stock -->
	<CE_DisposableRocketLauncher.tools.stock.label>枪托</CE_DisposableRocketLauncher.tools.stock.label>
	<!-- EN: barrel -->
	<CE_DisposableRocketLauncher.tools.barrel.label>枪管</CE_DisposableRocketLauncher.tools.barrel.label>
	<!-- EN: muzzle -->
	<CE_DisposableRocketLauncher.tools.muzzle.label>枪口</CE_DisposableRocketLauncher.tools.muzzle.label>
	<!-- EN: disposable rocket launcher -->
	<CE_DisposableRocketLauncher.verbs.Verb_ShootCEOneUse.label>一次性火箭发射器</CE_DisposableRocketLauncher.verbs.Verb_ShootCEOneUse.label>
	
	<!-- EN: flare gun -->
	<CE_FlareGun.label>信号枪</CE_FlareGun.label>
	<!-- EN: An ancient, single-shot flare gun, used for signaling or illumination. Loaded from the breech, its barrel is too thin to fire anything but flares. -->
	<CE_FlareGun.description>一种古老的单发信号枪，用于发送信号或提供照明。它从后膛装填，枪管过薄，只能发射信号弹。</CE_FlareGun.description>
	<!-- EN: grip -->
	<CE_FlareGun.tools.grip.label>握把</CE_FlareGun.tools.grip.label>
	<!-- EN: muzzle -->
	<CE_FlareGun.tools.muzzle.label>枪口</CE_FlareGun.tools.muzzle.label>
	<!-- EN: flare gun -->
	<CE_FlareGun.verbs.Verb_ShootFlareCE.label>信号枪</CE_FlareGun.verbs.Verb_ShootFlareCE.label>
	
	<!-- EN: grenade launcher -->
	<CE_GrenadeLauncher.label>榴弹发射器</CE_GrenadeLauncher.label>
	<!-- EN: A simple, locally produced break-action grenade launcher, capable of firing a variety of different projectiles. -->
	<CE_GrenadeLauncher.description>一种结构简单、可在本地生产的折开式榴弹发射器，能够发射多种投射物。</CE_GrenadeLauncher.description>
	<!-- EN: stock -->
	<CE_GrenadeLauncher.tools.stock.label>枪托</CE_GrenadeLauncher.tools.stock.label>
	<!-- EN: barrel -->
	<CE_GrenadeLauncher.tools.barrel.label>枪管</CE_GrenadeLauncher.tools.barrel.label>
	<!-- EN: muzzle -->
	<CE_GrenadeLauncher.tools.muzzle.label>枪口</CE_GrenadeLauncher.tools.muzzle.label>
	<!-- EN: grenade launcher -->
	<CE_GrenadeLauncher.verbs.Verb_ShootCE.label>榴弹发射器</CE_GrenadeLauncher.verbs.Verb_ShootCE.label>
	
	<!-- EN: minigun -->
	<CE_MechanoidMinigun.label>机械族速射机枪</CE_MechanoidMinigun.label>
	<!-- EN: A multi-barrel machine gun. It looks menacing with its long barrels and once it starts firing it fires very fast. Where most self-loading guns are powered by the energy from the gunpowder, the minigun uses an electric motor powered by the mechanoid it's mounted on to rapidly cycle cartridges through the weapon. -->
	<CE_MechanoidMinigun.description>一种多管机枪，修长的枪管极具威慑力，启动后射速惊人。大多数自装填枪械利用火药燃气驱动循环，而速射机枪使用由所搭载机械族供能的电动机，让弹药快速通过武器完成循环。</CE_MechanoidMinigun.description>
	<!-- EN: barrel -->
	<CE_MechanoidMinigun.tools.barrel.label>枪管</CE_MechanoidMinigun.tools.barrel.label>
	<!-- EN: minigun -->
	<CE_MechanoidMinigun.verbs.Verb_ShootCE.label>机械族速射机枪</CE_MechanoidMinigun.verbs.Verb_ShootCE.label>
	
	<!-- EN: thermal bolt projector -->
	<CE_ThermalBoltProjector.label>热能弹发射器</CE_ThermalBoltProjector.label>
	<!-- EN: A medium-velocity, low-trajectory fire support system deployed by mechanoids. While inaccurate and slow-firing, it remains a potent weapon against static targets. -->
	<CE_ThermalBoltProjector.description>机械族部署的一种中速、低弹道火力支援系统。虽然精度不高、射速较慢，但对静止目标仍十分有效。</CE_ThermalBoltProjector.description>
	<!-- EN: barrel -->
	<CE_ThermalBoltProjector.tools.barrel.label>枪管</CE_ThermalBoltProjector.tools.barrel.label>
	<!-- EN: thermal bolt projector -->
	<CE_ThermalBoltProjector.verbs.Verb_ShootMortarCE.label>热能弹发射器</CE_ThermalBoltProjector.verbs.Verb_ShootMortarCE.label>
	
</LanguageData>
